<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="head">
    <p class="eyebrow">How coaching works</p>
    <h2>Holistic coaching, focused on you</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="how">
    <div><h3>Tailored to you</h3><p>No two athletes have the same work and personal commitments, training history or injury history, so no two plans are the same. Each week is planned around your lifestyle, ability and goals, with specific paces and intensities for every session so you know exactly how hard to work.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Planned a week or two at a time</h3><p>Life changes quickly and training has to change with it. I don't hand over months of training and say good luck. You get one to two weeks at a time on Final Surge, based on your current fitness and what your schedule looks like.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Educate and empower</h3><p>I want you to know why you're doing each session, so you understand the training process, learn more about your body and become a more knowledgeable athlete.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Ongoing communication</h3><p>No goal is too ambitious and no question is too silly. You'll have my phone number and email, and can reach me by call, WhatsApp, email or through the app whenever you have questions.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="head">
    <p class="eyebrow">For every goal race</p>
    <h2>A race-day blueprint</h2>
    <p class="lede">Before each goal race you get a personalised plan for the day. It covers pace for each section of the course based on the terrain, when to take each gel and how much to drink, and the logistics from expo to start line. You go into the race knowing exactly what you're going to do.</p>
    <p class="muted">This is a real one, from the Vedanta Delhi Half Marathon 2026, with the athlete's personal details removed. They finished in 1:52, a PB by about six minutes.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="sheet bp-sheet" aria-label="Race-day blueprint from the Delhi Half Marathon 2026">
    <div class="sheet-top"><b>Race-Day Blueprint · Delhi Half Marathon</b><span class="tag">21.1 km · Gun 5:30 AM · JLN Stadium</span></div>
    <div class="goals">
      <div><p class="tag">Floor</p><p class="g-val">Under previous PB</p></div>
      <div class="main"><p class="tag">Target</p><p class="g-val mono">1:52–1:54</p><p class="g-sub">avg ~5:21/km · halfway ~57:00</p></div>
      <div><p class="tag">Green light</p><p class="g-val mono">~1:51</p><p class="g-sub">only if km 15 feels controlled</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tbl"><table class="bp-table">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Section</th><th scope="col">Km</th><th scope="col">Pace /km</th><th scope="col">What it should feel like</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Stadium exit and cobbles</td><td class="mono">0–1</td><td class="mono">5:28–5:32</td><td>Crowded and dark. Settle in, eyes on the ground at the cobbles. No weaving.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Lodhi Road</td><td class="mono">1–5</td><td class="mono">5:22–5:25</td><td>Find goal rhythm. Run the U-turn wide. Comfortably hard, could say a short sentence.</td></tr>
        <tr class="crux"><td>Mathura Road flyover</td><td class="mono">5–6.5</td><td class="mono">5:25–5:32</td><td>Hold effort, let the pace drop. Get it back on the way down without forcing it.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Zoo to India Gate</td><td class="mono">6.5–8</td><td class="mono">5:20–5:22</td><td>Back to rhythm. Don't chase the seconds lost on the flyover.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Kartavya Path and Sansad Marg</td><td class="mono">8–12</td><td class="mono">5:20–5:22</td><td>Long, flat and straight. Halfway at 56:30–57:30 is spot on.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>India Gate loop and War Memorial</td><td class="mono">12–15</td><td class="mono">5:17–5:20</td><td>The push starts here. Caffeine is in, sun is coming up. Green-light check at km 15.</td></tr>
        <tr class="crux"><td>Flyover 2 and narrow approach</td><td class="mono">15–19</td><td class="mono">5:18–5:25</td><td>Don't surge the climb. Same effort uphill, expect a few lost seconds in the congestion.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Lodhi Road home</td><td class="mono">19–21.1</td><td class="mono">5:05–5:10</td><td>Flat and fast. Mind the cobbles one last time, then empty it into the stadium.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <div class="fuel"><strong>Fuel:</strong> a gel 15 minutes before the gun, then one every 20 minutes (<span class="mono">0:20, 0:40, 1:00, 1:20, 1:40</span>), about 75 g carbs an hour. The second gel has caffeine so it kicks in for the second half. One salt cap an hour, and water at most stations.</div>
    <p class="g-sub sheet-note">The full blueprint also covers the weather and kit, carb loading for the two days before, and a race-morning timeline from wake-up to the gun.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Since 2019</p>
    <h2>Where PondiExpress athletes have raced</h2>
  </div>
  {%- set races =  ["Comrades Marathon","Tokyo Marathon","Berlin Marathon","London Marathon","Chicago Marathon","New York City Marathon","Amsterdam Marathon","Vienna Marathon","Manchester Marathon","Sydney Marathon","Mumbai Marathon","Hyderabad Marathon","Valencia Half","Paris Half","Barcelona Half","Munich Half","Gold Coast Half","Vilnius Half","Niagara Falls Half","Delhi Half Marathon","Toronto Island 10K","Chiang Mai by UTMB","Malnad Ultra","Border 100","Solang SkyUltra","Sinhagad Epic","Hyrox Delhi","Hyrox Bengaluru"] %}
  <div class="races" id="races">
    {%- for r in races %}
    <span class="race">{{ r }}</span>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <button type="button" class="races-more btn btn-ghost" aria-controls="races" aria-expanded="false" hidden>Show all {{ races | length }} races</button>
  <script>
  (function(){
    var list=document.getElementById('races'),btn=document.querySelector('.races-more');
    list.classList.add('collapsed');btn.hidden=false;
    btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
      var open=list.classList.toggle('collapsed')===false;
      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded',open);
      btn.textContent=open?'Show fewer':'Show all {{ races | length }} races';
    });
  })();
  </script>
</div></section>
